---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import hero from "../assets/motionhotel-hero.png";
import suite from "../assets/suite.png";
import dinner from "../assets/dinner.png";
---

<BaseLayout title="Our story" description="The slower side of a Greek island.">
  <section class="about-hero">
    <Image
      src={hero}
      alt="MotionHotel glowing above the Aegean at blue hour"
      widths={[768, 1200, 1600]}
      sizes="100vw"
      format="avif"
      loading="eager"
    />
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">OUR STORY</p>
      <h1>
        A house that knows
        <br />
        when to be quiet.
      </h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section about-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">AN ADDRESS WITH A POINT OF VIEW</p>
    <div>
      <h2>
        Built around the
        <br />
        <em>luxury of less.</em>
      </h2>
      <p>
        MotionHotel began with a simple idea: the best places do not compete
        with their setting. They let the landscape lead—the light, the wind, the
        line where the sea meets the sky.
      </p>
      <p>
        We made a small hotel for people who want to arrive, put the phone down,
        and remember how long a day can feel.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="about-values">
    <article>
      <span>01</span>
      <h2>Local by nature</h2>
      <p>
        From stone and timber to the food on your plate, we choose makers and
        ingredients from nearby whenever we can.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>02</span>
      <h2>Thoughtful, not precious</h2>
      <p>
        Beautiful things are made to be used. Linen gets rumpled, doors stay
        open, and no one minds sandy feet.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>03</span>
      <h2>Lightly here</h2>
      <p>
        We keep the footprint small: water-conscious planting, seasonal menus
        and a deep respect for the place we call home.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
  <section class="about-image-text">
    <div>
      <Image
        src={suite}
        alt="A restful MotionHotel suite overlooking the sea"
        widths={[640, 960, 1280]}
        sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 50vw"
        format="avif"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">THE ROOMS</p>
      <h2>For sleeping late and waking well.</h2>
      <p>
        Twenty-eight rooms and suites each have their own character, but all
        share the same quiet palette: warm stone, natural linen, handmade
        objects and light that moves across the walls all day.
      </p>
      <a class="small-link" href="/rooms">
        Find your room &#8599;
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="about-quote">
    <blockquote>
      “We want every guest to leave with a little more space inside their day.”
    </blockquote>
    <cite>— ELENI & NIKOS, FOUNDERS</cite>
  </section>
  <section class="section about-closing">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">COME AS YOU ARE</p>
      <h2>There is room for you here.</h2>
      <p>
        For an anniversary, a solo escape, a long-overdue conversation, or
        simply a change of air.
      </p>
      <a class="btn" href="/contact">
        Make an enquiry &#8599;
      </a>
    </div>
    <Image
      src={dinner}
      alt="MotionHotel dinner terrace at dusk"
      widths={[640, 960, 1280]}
      sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 45vw"
      format="avif"
      loading="lazy"
    />
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
